Relevant columns & how they will be used  
• `event_date` : cohort‑filter (20180702‑20180708), retention‑filter (≤ 20181002) and to convert to a Monday‑based week start date.  
• `event_name` : keep only `session_start` events (a “contact” with the app).  
• `user_pseudo_id` : anonymous user key to build the cohort and to measure “returning”.  
• `_TABLE_SUFFIX` (implicit pseudo‑column when a wildcard is used) : restrict the scan to the needed physical day tables.  

Typical conditions  
```sql
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20180702' AND '20181002'
  AND event_name = 'session_start'
```  
Week‑start (Monday) helper  
```sql
DATE_TRUNC(PARSE_DATE('%Y%m%d',event_date), WEEK(MONDAY))   -- returns the Monday of the week
```  

